## Frontend build output (Vite etc.) — deliberately NOT wwwroot/lib/**/dist, which is where the
## ASP.NET Core MVC template's libman-restored Bootstrap/jQuery actually live and need to be
## committed for the app to render styled at all.
node_modules/
src/frontend/*/dist/
build/
verify-screenshots/
!**/wwwroot/lib/**

## Java (itsm-bridge)
target/
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

## Python (alert-simulator) — native/log-parser-shim's dist/ is deliberately NOT here: that build
## output (a tiny native DLL/exe from build.ps1) is committed on purpose so the solution builds
## out of the box after a fresh clone without requiring gcc to be installed first.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

